<title>USA: Caldwell Cty, N.C., won by First Union.</title>
<headline>Caldwell Cty, N.C., won by First Union.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union said it won $3 million of Caldwell Cty, N.C., general obligation public improvement bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.87 percent.</p>
</text>
